cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the concept DOI, which resolves to the latest archived release."
title: "A real affine (23_4) configuration"
type: software
version: "v1.2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-10"
authors:
  - family-names: Strinz
    given-names: Will
abstract: >-
  An explicit configuration of 23 distinct real affine points and 23 distinct
  lines, with exactly four selected incidences at every point and line.
  Includes a rational Lean-verified construction, a second construction over
  Q(sqrt(17)), and exact evidence that these are the two projective classes
  admitting a Klein four-group of collineations. Publication priority is not
  asserted.
keywords:
  - incidence geometry
  - geometric configurations
  - "23_4"
  - Lean
  - formal proof
  - rational construction
  - projective equivalence
  - Klein four-group
